en the fallback fires. Estimated savings: ~5% per CLI call (negligible overall, but clean).\n\n**4. Repeated `hash.String()[:12]` (FALSE ALARM)**  \nLines 320, 330, 335, 339 in `readTreeEntriesViaCLI`: three short-string slices on a hot path, but only when the error path fires. Compiler inlines and likely unrolls these; no dedup needed. Cost is ~3 ns per call. Ignore.\n\n**5. Sequential CLI calls during single recursion (FALSE ALARM)**  \nIf multiple shards under the same root all fail in go-git in a single `ApplyTreeChanges` call, each gets its own subprocess. But: shards are independent subtrees; you cannot pre-fetch the parent once and avoid the children without re-architecting the whole tree surgery logic. Over-engineering risk outweighs the cold-path win. Acceptable as-is.\n\n### Recommendation  \nAdd 2-line prealloc in `readTreeEntriesViaCLI` (count newlines, then cap entries slice). Everything else is fine."}],"totalDurationMs":37986,"totalTokens":39977,"totalToolUseCount":15,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":866,"cache_read_input_tokens":38294,"output_tokens":813,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":866},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":4,"output_tokens":813,"cache_read_input_tokens":38294,"cache_creation_input_tokens":866,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":866,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"toolStats":{"readCount":9,"searchCount":0,"bashCount":6,"editFileCount":0,"linesAdded":0,"linesRemoved":0,"otherToolCount":0}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"6f5fa1ca-cdd1-422e-9559-2f07bc875c3e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/ninawork/entire/devenv/cli","sessionId":"ef1c89a4-1068-47aa-89f0-d39c11780572","version":"2.1.139","gitBranch":"migrate-failed-commit-bug"}
